    notes: >-
      07K phase expansion wires (B37–B46) are added at Phase 3 as part of the 07K
      engine-side mating plug build. The cabin-side connectors (BULKHEAD_B_CABIN) are
      pre-wired to those cavities at initial build — only the engine-side plug changes.
      Crank VR+/−/shield (B15–B17): shielded twisted pair. Shield terminates at
      cabin-side CMC H1 (sensor GND), floating at engine side. Keep this sub-loom
      away from injector/coil wires per isolation rule in loom-routing.md.


